You are reviewing the outcome of a two-step code pipeline. Two AI models worked in sequence, each writing one Python function. Step 1 (Claude) wrote `compute_result`. Step 2 (Gemma) wrote `summarize_order`, which uses `compute_result`. Each step saw only the code and notes passed to it. After step 2 an automated integration check ran the assembled module.

